# Line endings are part of this repository's test contract.
#
# Several suites compare bytes: the audit differential and the stage-wave
# goldens assert byte-identity against committed fixtures. With git's default
# Windows behaviour those fixtures are checked out CRLF while the code that
# produces them emits LF, so the comparison fails on Windows and nowhere
# else — a portability failure manufactured by the checkout rather than by
# the code.
#
# Normalize text to LF in the working tree on every platform. Assets are
# marked binary so they are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.plugin binary
